WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:29.940
More than 3.5 times the substrate capacity for NVIDIA starts in 2027, binding six manufacturers to the ramp. This is AI Chips &amp; Data Centres, episode 58. After that, a weekly rule for handing out waifers, a wind-farm tied to a foundry, and Singapore's answer on chip checks. Your story names the six as Amcore, Foxconn, Kinsus, Samsung Electromechanics, SPIL, and TSMC, and the work run

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:35.700
from substrates and advanced packaging through waifers, contract manufacturing and system assembly.

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:41.760
Kinsis is doing that substrate build at its youth campus in Tau Yuan, on advanced ABF

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:47.460
package substrate reserved for NVIDIA, with output expected in the second half of 2027.

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:52.500
AMCORE's piece is multi-year packaging capacity in Arizona and South Korea.

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:57.540
Agreements announced in July and October 2026, nearly $3 billion,

00:00:57.540 --> 00:01:02.560
dollars and the money includes prepayments so AMCOR can build ahead of NVIDIA's schedule.

00:01:03.340 --> 00:01:06.900
SPIL's multi-year deal, backed by multi-billion dollar funding,

00:01:07.460 --> 00:01:11.660
covers bumping, interposer wafer fabrication, assembly and testing,

00:01:12.260 --> 00:01:16.880
and digitimes reports it is set to triple advanced packaging capacity by 2029.

00:01:17.640 --> 00:01:22.820
Samsung Electromechanics amended an existing substrate contract to tighten factory operations

00:01:22.820 --> 00:01:28.780
in South Korea, on top of earlier work in Seijong and Busan for computing and high-speed networking.

00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:34.840
Foxconn is stretching the same collaboration onto next-generation GPU and networking platforms,

00:01:35.340 --> 00:01:42.760
using plants in Asia, North America and Europe. NVIDIA said Vera Rubin NVL72 and the Vera CPUs

00:01:42.760 --> 00:01:49.180
began volume shipments in the third quarter, built on TSMC's 5 nanometer and 3 nanometer processes

00:01:49.180 --> 00:01:57.925
and on Kowowas packaging. Lenovo, in a tech-times note, lists a Vera Ruben rack at 227 kilowatts set

00:01:57.925 --> 00:02:04.165
against Penguin Solutions' own Vera Ruben rack launch. Taiwan Mask, a star-fusion group subsidiary,

00:02:04.465 --> 00:02:10.605
is adding 14-inch capacity, digitimes reported, while it reshapes its product mix and pushes overseas

00:02:10.605 --> 00:02:16.785
for advanced packaging, including Kowowas, plus silicon photonics and advanced node photo masks.

00:02:16.785 --> 00:02:24.425
Kudora, a brown-schwig company founded in 2021, has put NVIDIA CUDAQ into its software kit so

00:02:24.425 --> 00:02:30.505
hybrid programs can run on Q-Mellion, an emulator that models noise on the trapped ion machines it

00:02:30.505 --> 00:02:36.685
has not yet shipped. HPC Wire said the firm's near-field quantum control uses integrated microwave

00:02:36.685 --> 00:02:42.825
electronics to drive those ions. In an architecture, Kudora calls compatible with ordinary semiconductor

00:02:42.825 --> 00:02:48.585
doctor manufacturing. The CUDA-Q link is available now. The machines are offered on premises

00:02:48.585 --> 00:02:54.885
and in the cloud, and the Asia Pacific push runs through Cudora, Japan. High-long, off-Taiwan

00:02:54.885 --> 00:03:01.445
central coast is energized. Digitime said construction is finished, all 73 turbines are on the grid,

00:03:01.885 --> 00:03:08.960
and the project is one gigawatt, with that power meant to supply TSMC in 2027. Data center knowledge

00:03:08.960 --> 00:03:14.220
finds developers reopening assumptions about permits, tax breaks, and who pays the utility,

00:03:14.680 --> 00:03:18.220
including in states that had invited the buildings. In Pennsylvania,

00:03:18.700 --> 00:03:23.000
Stacey Garrity went from praising Amazon's $20 billion data center investment

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:29.160
to backing a pause and tighter requirements, and Governor Josh Shapiro moved from faster permitting

00:03:29.160 --> 00:03:34.340
towards stricter environmental standards and more transparency. Spotlight PA reported.

00:03:34.340 --> 00:03:41.220
In Wisconsin, Governor-Elect David Crowley backed a pause and an end to the industry's state-sales tax exemption.

00:03:41.680 --> 00:03:49.980
And after the election, he was weighing resource use disclosures, a community support test, and rules so energy costs do not land on residents.

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:58.580
Global data's count is the schedule hit, projects that broke ground between the 3rd quarter of 2025 and the 3rd quarter of 2026,

00:03:58.580 --> 00:04:03.460
waited just over two years from announcement to construction against about 18

00:04:03.460 --> 00:04:09.620
months for projects launched from early 2020 to mid-2025. IDC analysts, Srinivas,

00:04:09.960 --> 00:04:14.380
DuVore, Venkata put community acceptance next to power, interconnection and

00:04:14.380 --> 00:04:18.840
environmental permits, and set approval conditions can mean the developer pays all

00:04:18.840 --> 00:04:24.400
utility costs, meets a renewable requirement, uses closed-loop cooling and stays on

00:04:24.400 --> 00:04:26.080
designated industrial land.

00:04:26.560 --> 00:04:31.180
Austin Mason at Old Castle Infrastructure said a team can have the power plan finished

00:04:31.180 --> 00:04:35.420
and still be waiting on environmental permits for the on-site generation equipment.

00:04:36.475 --> 00:04:44.275
Memphis is writing the first large check under its community benefit ordinance, $3,259,282,

00:04:45.115 --> 00:04:50.855
taken from tax on SpaceX AI's Colossus 1, which Tom's hardware notes has been operating

00:04:50.855 --> 00:04:52.295
since May 2025.

00:04:52.295 --> 00:04:59.695
$2 million of it funds the Hope Home Repair Program, up to $25,000 per low or moderate income

00:04:59.695 --> 00:05:05.355
homeowner or renter, structured as a deferred, interest-free, forgivable loan with no monthly

00:05:05.355 --> 00:05:12.115
payment and forgiven after three years. $125,000 is marked for cooling and air quality equipment

00:05:12.115 --> 00:05:19.170
for residents, Deb Shokwist and Vidya's Executive Vice President of Operations told Biggo Finance

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:25.330
she screened suppliers on three tests, a ramp that matches Nvidia, precision enough for the design,

00:05:25.570 --> 00:05:30.210
and a balance sheet that can invest before the orders arrive. If a company has only two,

00:05:30.470 --> 00:05:35.330
Nvidia puts capital in. She named TSMC, a partner since 1998,

00:05:35.910 --> 00:05:42.910
plus Foxconn, Whistron, SPIL, KYEC, packaging and test partners for more than 20 years,

00:05:43.550 --> 00:05:46.590
Unimicron, Amphenol, Coherent, and Lumentum.

00:05:46.770 --> 00:05:52.170
She sits with major suppliers every quarter and spends six weeks a year in Taiwan, mainland

00:05:52.170 --> 00:05:55.570
China, South Korea, Vietnam, and the United States.

00:05:56.210 --> 00:06:01.150
Optics partners had the technology and not the factory scale, which is why NVIDIA took

00:06:01.150 --> 00:06:06.470
investment stakes in Coherent and Lumentum and is standing up a separate chain for co-packaged

00:06:06.470 --> 00:06:06.890
optics.

00:06:06.890 --> 00:06:13.290
6. Amphenol's cable assembly carries 1,500 branches, each built so the defect rate stays

00:06:13.290 --> 00:06:19.050
under 1 per million, on more than 100 automated lines in Vietnam, and that assembly is in

00:06:19.050 --> 00:06:24.570
full production. After packaging, wafers are handed out weekly. A plant with weak output

00:06:24.570 --> 00:06:29.710
or a holding period that misses the plan does not get more chips that week, and each die

00:06:29.710 --> 00:06:34.510
is traced from its identification number to the customer invoice. When the schedule demands

00:06:34.510 --> 00:06:40.410
it, the path from chips leaving TSMC to systems leaving Foxconn and Wistron, can shrink from

00:06:40.410 --> 00:06:45.790
five weeks to two. On one compute board ramp, automated test handling missed its throughput.

00:06:46.350 --> 00:06:50.890
The line stopped, manual loading came back with as many as several hundred operators,

00:06:51.390 --> 00:06:57.870
and an internal push called swarm redesign trays, hardware, software, and yield, with Foxconn's

00:06:57.870 --> 00:07:03.891
automation engineers before the ramp restarted. A day after the November 16th licensing rule,

00:07:03.891 --> 00:07:08.971
Prime Minister Lawrence Wong said Singapore can host American checks on how advanced chips

00:07:08.971 --> 00:07:14.411
are used in the city, will not enforce another country's export controls, and will act firmly

00:07:14.411 --> 00:07:16.891
against firms that use Singapore to dodge them.

00:07:17.451 --> 00:07:21.911
The Straits Times quoted his point that only a small volume actually enters the country.

00:07:22.311 --> 00:07:29.311
2025 figures had Nvidia booking Singapore as 22% of global chip sales revenue, with 1% of

00:07:29.311 --> 00:07:30.251
the chips used there.

00:07:30.251 --> 00:07:36.751
That same day, Josephine Tio and US under Secretary Jeffrey Kessler agreed to work out practical

00:07:36.751 --> 00:07:42.391
steps so trusted users keep access, which the digital development ministry confirmed on November

00:07:42.391 --> 00:07:48.591
18th. And Deputy Prime Minister Gann Kim Yong said Singapore will act against anyone who breaks its

00:07:48.591 --> 00:07:54.511
laws. China's Commerce Ministry on November 17th said the tighter controls cut against the leaders

00:07:54.511 --> 00:07:59.571
consensus, and that Beijing will answer with countermeasures if Washington stays on this path.

00:08:00.471 --> 00:08:05.731
Zao Bao reported the operational bite, an overseas data center that gives substantial computing

00:08:05.731 --> 00:08:12.031
capacity to a company headquartered in China has 90 days to get a US export license or face further

00:08:12.031 --> 00:08:18.071
restrictions, and each application is reviewed on its own. The license covers export, re-export,

00:08:18.071 --> 00:08:23.971
and transfer of advanced semiconductors to Singapore, Malaysia, Thailand, Indonesia, and Brazil.

00:08:24.651 --> 00:08:30.211
Also on the desk, HPC Wire carried Lambda's claim of the first co-packaged optics deployment

00:08:30.211 --> 00:08:37.131
of Blackwell GPUs. Rykin said unauthorized access to a system used to run the Fugaku Supercomputer

00:08:37.131 --> 00:08:43.291
was confirmed on November 13th, with a possible personal data leak for Fugaku and RyQ users.

00:08:43.291 --> 00:08:50.211
Harvey Jones and Vidya's board chairman said on the 3rd quarter fiscal 2027 earnings call that

00:08:50.211 --> 00:08:55.451
the board accepted Jensen Huang's resignation unanimously and does not intend to bring him back

00:08:55.451 --> 00:09:01.551
as chief executive. The information reported that NVIDIA introduced Alibaba to Alice Huang as a

00:09:01.551 --> 00:09:08.571
workaround on US export controls. Investing live reported that TSMC is asking AI chip clients for

00:09:08.571 --> 00:09:11.791
cash up front, citing fears of circular financing.

00:09:12.754 --> 00:09:17.794
Release film keeps hot epoxy off the compression mold, and if you take it apart as a process

00:09:17.794 --> 00:09:23.634
step, Biggo Finance's account of Sure Giant shows why the sheet, not the resin pump, decides

00:09:23.634 --> 00:09:25.354
whether the next package is clean.

00:09:25.974 --> 00:09:30.234
In icy packaging, the mold presses hot resin around the dye and the substrate.

00:09:30.874 --> 00:09:35.574
Reson that wets the steel contaminates the following shot and can tear the part on the way out.

00:09:35.574 --> 00:09:41.294
Chairman Yang Yoon-Pin described the film as the isolator under high temperature and high pressure.

00:09:41.834 --> 00:09:44.734
The layer that lets the package leave the tool without residue.

00:09:45.454 --> 00:09:48.454
Yang said Japanese rivals mostly extrude that film.

00:09:49.054 --> 00:09:52.834
Sure-Giant coats it using more than 25 years of formulation work

00:09:52.834 --> 00:09:57.094
from an optoelectronics business that entered semiconductors in 2014.

00:09:57.914 --> 00:10:01.214
Coding is how you cut a sample for one customer's automated line.

00:10:01.214 --> 00:10:06.614
The line scores three things. The sheet must not stick, it must leave no adhesive, and

00:10:06.614 --> 00:10:11.454
the release force has to match the tool. An extruded film can hit the same force number

00:10:11.454 --> 00:10:15.814
and still fail if the surface chemistry is not the one that mold and resin were qualified

00:10:15.814 --> 00:10:21.874
on. The custom sample is the product. The mold face changed with the package. Sure Giants

00:10:21.874 --> 00:10:28.294
film went into mass production for 2.5D advanced packaging in 2024, into panel level fan

00:10:28.294 --> 00:10:36.914
out in 2025 and toward 3D packaging in 2026. 2.5D is a wide, flatter compression. Fan-out on

00:10:36.914 --> 00:10:43.034
a panel moves more resin across a larger area. A 3D stack adds height and more places for residue

00:10:43.034 --> 00:10:49.194
to hide. Appeal tests can pass and an automated camera can still reject the part. Sure-giant says it

00:10:49.194 --> 00:10:55.054
is qualified at the world's top five semiconductor manufacturers, with film already running in first-tier

00:10:55.054 --> 00:10:59.314
advance packaging. Orders are visible for two to three years, and customer

00:10:59.314 --> 00:11:04.094
forecasts run five to six years, so the coding line is booked to a package road map.

00:11:04.814 --> 00:11:10.094
Plant 1 is full, Tau Yuan Plant 2 finished trial production, and is expected to start

00:11:10.094 --> 00:11:15.814
official output in December, at two and a half to three times Plant 1, with a full year

00:11:15.814 --> 00:11:23.534
of contribution in 2027. The books for the first three quarters of 2026, revenue of $333 million

00:11:23.534 --> 00:11:30.754
New Taiwan dollars, about $10.1 million US dollars, gross profit $229 million New Taiwan

00:11:30.754 --> 00:11:38.514
dollars, operating profit $175 million, after tax profit $140 million, earnings per share

00:11:38.514 --> 00:11:47.454
$6.35 New Taiwan dollars, third quarter revenue was $159 million New Taiwan dollars, up 80.76%

00:11:47.454 --> 00:11:54.014
from the prior quarter, and quarterly aftertax profit was $66.51 million new Taiwan dollars,

00:11:54.334 --> 00:12:01.394
up 92.72%. Multiplying the floor space by two and a half to three does not multiply profit by

00:12:01.394 --> 00:12:07.454
itself. Yang is counting on a larger share of high margin advanced packaging film inside that volume.

00:12:08.074 --> 00:12:13.014
That coating sheet loses its place as the gate on shipments once the critical step is no longer

00:12:13.014 --> 00:12:14.874
repealing resin off a compression mold.

00:12:15.574 --> 00:12:20.354
Grinding tape already sold to the world's top 10 packaging plants for more than 12 years

00:12:20.754 --> 00:12:25.814
is the second product, and a thick single adhesive layer version went to first-tier verification

00:12:26.154 --> 00:12:30.494
in the fourth quarter of 2026 for taller bumps and thinner wafers.

00:12:30.974 --> 00:12:36.254
The third product is hydrolyzable tape, meant to replace temporary bonds that today need

00:12:36.254 --> 00:12:41.854
a laser or ultraviolet debond, using the plants existing pure water clean and skipping the

00:12:41.854 --> 00:12:48.454
chemical bath. Official samples are expected in mid-2027, with a gradual ramp in 2028.

00:12:49.054 --> 00:12:53.754
When the line is releasing a thinned, bonded wafer in pure water, the argument between

00:12:53.754 --> 00:12:59.337
extrusion and coating on release film no longer picks the supplier who can ship. On the

00:12:59.337 --> 00:13:05.397
horizon, sure giants move onto the OTC market as expected in mid-December, at a tentative price

00:13:05.397 --> 00:13:08.137
of $438 new Taiwan dollars a share.

00:13:08.837 --> 00:13:14.497
ASEAN has agreed with China's proposal to mark 2027 as the year of ASEAN-China AI

00:13:14.497 --> 00:13:18.497
cooperation, and the talks on actual projects are still early.

